{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1432555-it-drives-me-crazy","id":1432555,"title":"It drives me crazy","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-01-17T16:46:07-08:00","id":1432555,"title":"It drives me crazy","content":"This isn't a big thing, just something that's driving me crazy.<br /> <br /> A while ago I remember going over some splat or another in one of the books and seeing one of the usual lists of character concepts (like the ones in the Tribes chapter in the Werewolf core book and so on \u2013 you know the ones, almost every splat has those somewhere).<br /> <br /> Anyway, in one of the books of one of the splats there was one such list or sample concepts and one of them was &quot;movie monster&quot;. It didn't interest me at the time, but now I was toying with some character concepts and recalled seeing it and I wanted to remember which splat it was and where it came from.<br /> <br /> Does anyone know what I'm talking about?<br /> I'm convinced it was in one of the Chronicles of Darkness books, but I looked and I can't find or recall even which splat I saw it in.<br /> <br /> I remember seeing it <i>somewhere</i>, but I can't for the life of me remember <i>where</i> and it will not leave me alone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1807-serpent-axis","name":"Serpent Axis","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1807_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"135"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-01-17T19:51:30-08:00","id":1432573,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_con